# Draft Events

## Purpose

This chapter defines every canonical event governing draft assets and rookie drafts.

Draft Picks are unique assets because they represent future ownership rather than current ownership.

Unlike Players, Draft Picks are entirely virtual until exercised.

Legacy treats Draft Picks as first-class assets that may be traded, valued, projected, and analyzed years before they become Players.

---

# Guiding Principle

Draft Picks are assets.

Draft Selections consume Draft Picks.

Players are created through Draft Selections.

Ownership begins with Draft Picks.

---

