# Scope

This chapter defines:

- RookieDraftCreated
- RookieDraftStarted
- RookieDraftPaused
- RookieDraftResumed
- RookieDraftCompleted

- DraftPickCreated
- DraftPickTransferred
- DraftPickForfeited
- DraftPickConsumed

- DraftSelectionMade
- DraftSelectionCorrected

---

# General Invariants

Every draft event shall satisfy:

1. Every Draft Pick belongs to exactly one Franchise.
2. A Draft Pick may only be consumed once.
3. Draft order must remain deterministic.
4. Draft Picks remain tradable until consumed.
5. Every Draft Selection references one Draft Pick.
6. Every Draft Selection creates exactly one Player acquisition.
7. Historical draft order is immutable.
8. Historical selections never change.

