# RookieDraftCreated

## Purpose

Creates a new Rookie Draft for a League Season.

---

### Business Impact

• Creates draft schedule

• Creates draft order

• Enables future selections

• Enables draft trading

• AI generates rookie projections

---

# RookieDraftStarted

Purpose

Opens draft for live selections.

---

Business Impact

• Picks become active

• Draft timers begin

• Trading rules may change

---

# RookieDraftPaused

Purpose

Temporarily suspends draft.

---

Business Impact

• Stops timers

• Freezes pick advancement

---

# RookieDraftResumed

Purpose

Continues paused draft.

---

Business Impact

• Timers resume

• Draft continues

---

# RookieDraftCompleted

Purpose

Represents completion of the Rookie Draft.

---

Business Impact

• Remaining picks expire

• Rookies now owned

• Future draft created

• League projections update

---

# DraftPickCreated

Purpose

Creates a future Draft Pick.

---

Business Impact

• Creates tradable asset

• Appears in Franchise inventory

• AI values future asset

---

# DraftPickTransferred

Purpose

Transfers ownership of a Draft Pick.

---

Business Impact

• Changes draft capital

• Changes future roster outlook

• Alters rebuilding timeline

• Alters contender timeline

• Invalidates trade values

---

# DraftPickForfeited

Purpose

Represents loss of draft asset due to League Rules.

---

Business Impact

• Removes draft capital

• Updates draft order

• AI removes future asset

---

# DraftSelectionMade

Purpose

Consumes a Draft Pick to acquire a Player.

---

Business Impact

• Consumes Draft Pick

• Creates Roster Assignment

• Creates Contract

• Adds Player ownership

• Updates rookie rankings

• Updates League evaluations

---

# DraftSelectionCorrected

Purpose

Corrects administrative draft errors.

---

Business Impact

• Updates historical record

• Maintains audit
